lantern-pr 1
# 50
#title feat: add Uninstall to the Settings command line panel
#url https://github.com/MobileReality/lantern/pull/50
#branch feat/settings-uninstall-cli
#base feat/windows-installer
#opened 2026-11-13
#head fbbafc3a1d26078afd974042ffabac6bdf3bcb7b
#describe what The Settings command line panel gets an Uninstall button, shown only when the lantern command is installed, wired through a new cli:uninstall IPC channel to the platform uninstall.
#describe before The panel could Install or Reinstall; removing the command meant running rm or del by hand.
#describe after An installed command shows Uninstall; one click removes it and the panel redraws as Not installed, with the Windows new-terminal note or an inline error.
#describe verified pnpm run typecheck, pnpm test and the cli-panel test are green; the new tests failed before the change.
#plan windows-squirrel-installer s2.1
~ src/main/main.ts
~ src/preload/workspace.ts
~ src/renderer/features/cli-panel.ts
~ src/renderer/global.d.ts
~ test/cli-panel.test.ts
#order src/renderer/global.d.ts
#order src/main/main.ts
#order src/preload/workspace.ts
#order src/renderer/features/cli-panel.ts
#order test/cli-panel.test.ts
#reason src/main/main.ts Serves the uninstall through the same per-platform split install already uses.
#reason src/preload/workspace.ts Exposes the uninstall call to the renderer through invoke only, so no raw ipcRenderer leaks.
#reason src/renderer/features/cli-panel.ts Lets a person remove the lantern command from Settings instead of deleting the link by hand.
#reason src/renderer/global.d.ts Types the new bridge call like cliInstall so the panel type-checks.
#reason test/cli-panel.test.ts Pins that Uninstall shows only when installed and is called once, with the note and error shown.
#story Remove the lantern command from Settings
#step actor A person with the command installed
#file src/renderer/features/cli-panel.ts
#step action clicks Uninstall in the command line panel
#file src/preload/workspace.ts
#file src/main/main.ts
#step subject the lantern command on their system
#file src/main/main.ts
#below interaction Sees the panel switch to Not installed, with any new-terminal note
#file test/cli-panel.test.ts
#below consequence Removing it meant deleting the link by hand => One click removes it on every OS
